Try:

MH1 <- zelig(
                          onset ~ L_PC_PRODUCTION,
                          data = mhd,
                          model = "relogit",
                          tau = 88/5269,
                          case.control = "weighting",
                          robust = TRUE
                          )

I believe the issue is that the variables should not be prefixed with "mhd$".

- Matt


